[A#]Naate hain [F]naato ka kya
[F]Hoga [A#]masiha... [F]
[F]Hoga [A#]masiha [F]saamne tere,
[A#]Phir bhi na [F]tu bach paayega
[F]Tera [A#]apnaae [F]
[F]Tera [A#]apna khoon [F]hi aakhir
[A#]tujhko [F]aag lagaayega
[F]Aasmaan mein...
[F]Aasmaan me [D#]udne waale
[A#m]mitti mein [F]mil jaayega
[F]Kasme waade [D#]pyaar wafaa sab,
[D#]Baatein hain [F]baato ka kya
[F]Sukh [A#]mein [F]tere...
